        "text": "Yes, `bun run dev:cf` (or `pnpm dev:cf`) from the repo root is all you need. It runs `pnpm --filter @paperclipai/deploy-cloudflare dev`, which inside `packages/deploy-cloudflare` runs the build then starts `wrangler dev --no-bundle --local` on port 8787.\n\nIt picks up `.dev.vars` automatically (which sets `DEPLOYMENT_MODE=local_trusted` to bypass auth and the setup gate), and connects to your local postgres via the `localConnectionString` in `wrangler.toml`.",
